  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.42: Bundle complete installed-version documentation and synthetic historical-refresh examples with offline eh docs list/show/export commands. Replace CLI documentation pointers with offline topic commands. Give check-refresh native exits 0 for ready, 3 for blocked and 1 for invalid input or expected operational failure; preserve usage 2 and cancellation 130 and document PowerShell exit propagation. Include the complete historical-refresh integration contract and tested conditional note adapter. EHE values, fixed-eight allocation, rounding and rates are unchanged. EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated; original workdays remain unresolved without external evidence. No time-entry writes. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.42/CHANGELOG.md",
